			"id": "ch1",
			"title": {
				"en": "No Turn Back",
				"es": "Sin vuelta atrás"
			},
			"pages": [
				{
					"id": "ch1pg1",
					"pubDate": "2026-06-20T17:05:53",
					"page_type": "paginated",
					"page_length": 1,
					"thumbnail": "comic/ch1/ch1pg1/ch1pg1_thumb.jpg",
					"title": {
						"en": "",
						"es": ""
					},
					"image_filename": {
						"en": "comic/ch1/ch1pg1/ch1pg1_en.jpg",
						"es": "comic/ch1/ch1pg1/ch1pg1_es.jpg"
					},
					"author_comment": {
						"en": "Hello everyone! <br> I've been waiting for the right time to start publishing this series, but I finally decided on a random date or I would never get myself to start. Life is full of events made to prevent you from starting your webcomic, so one just has to start it. <br> I hope you enjoy this self indulgent story. <br> Special thanks to <a href='https://bsky.app/profile/trashbird.gay'>Rook</a>, who programmed this site's template. It's in test stage, but will soon be releasing a version that everyone can use. <i>-Lumaga</i>",
						"es": "Hola, todos! <br> He estado esperando por el momento justo para empezar a publicar esta serie, pero finalmente me decidí por un día cualquiera  o no empezaría nunca. La vida está llena de eventos hechos para  prevenir que empieces tu webcomic, así que solo hay que empezarlo. <br> Espero que disfruten de esta historia llena de cosas que me gustan. <br> Muchas gracias a <a href='https://bsky.app/profile/trashbird.gay'>Rook</a>, quien programó este sitio, está en etapa de testeo pero pronto estará disponible para que todos la usen para sus webcomcis."
					}
				},
