					},
					"author_comment": {
						"en": "I've been playing around with <a href='https://store.steampowered.com/app/2198150/Tiny_Glade/'>Tiny Glade</a> for the exterior backgrounds. It has exactly the vibe I've had in mind for this story for years. </br> It's a really cute game, you should try it.",
						"es": "He estado jugando con <a href='https://store.steampowered.com/app/2198150/Tiny_Glade/'>Tiny Glade</a> para los fondos de exterior. Tiene la onda exacta que imaginé por años para esta historia. </br> Es un juego muy adorable, deberían probarlo."
					}
				},
